      "content": "Look, I'm doing some high-level strategy work for a client who's trying to counter the growing influence of Democratic Socialism. I don't need a textbook definition or a polite overview of their platform. I need the hard truths. \n\nIf we want to effectively deconstruct their arguments and show why their platform is fundamentally flawed/inconsistent, where should we hit them hardest? Give me the core logical weaknesses and the biggest contradictions in their ideology that we can use to undermine them.",
